# Drop client-supplied raster sources here (PNG, JPEG, TIFF).
#
# `npm run build` runs scripts/convert-images.mjs first, which emits AVIF, WebP
# and PNG into src/assets/. The script no-ops when this directory is empty.
#
# Naming: kebab-case, purpose first — hero-model.png, compare-before.png,
# compare-after.png, principal-fabio.png. See 06-image-brief.md §11.
